# The repository root ignores `*.txt`, which silently swallowed three fixtures
# this crate's tests read by name — `sacct.txt` (the frame every test in
# tests/autopsy.rs starts from) and the InfiniBand counter samples. Untracked,
# CI fails at "reading fixture sacct.txt", and the failure looks like a bug in
# the parser rather than a missing file.
#
# `!*` rather than `!*.txt`: the directory holds `.ndjson` and `.out` fixtures
# too, and a future root-level pattern for either would reintroduce exactly the
# same failure. Everything in a fixtures directory is source by definition.
#
# Scoped here rather than weakening the root rule, which still applies
# everywhere else in the monorepo.
!*
